			<item>
				<title>New Home Office</title>
				<link>https://noone.dev/2010/01/27/new-home-office/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 27 Jan 2010 21:08:09 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://noone.dev/2010/01/27/new-home-office/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;After a few weeks of shopping in and around Portland, we finally landed some nice office furniture at a reasonable price.  &lt;a title=&#34;City Liquidators&#34; href=&#34;http://cityliquidators.com/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;City Liquidators&lt;/a&gt; turns out to be the place for furniture (and other things ranging from tampons to sofas).  Next up, we’ll be painting the room.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;img class=&#34;alignnone&#34; title=&#34;furniture&#34; src=&#34;https://i1.wp.com/farm5.static.flickr.com/4015/4306216721_d9de598e7b_m_d.jpg?resize=240%2C179&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; data-recalc-dims=&#34;1&#34; /&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>New Couch</title>
				<link>https://noone.dev/2009/11/25/new-couch/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2009 16:19:19 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://noone.dev/2009/11/25/new-couch/</guid>
				<description>&lt;figure style=&#34;width: 100px&#34; class=&#34;wp-caption alignleft&#34;&gt;[&lt;img class=&#34; &#34; style=&#34;margin-right: 6px;&#34; title=&#34;couch&#34; src=&#34;https://i1.wp.com/farm3.static.flickr.com/2771/4126822232_7e00781af8_t_d.jpg?resize=100%2C67&#34; alt=&#34;couch&#34; data-recalc-dims=&#34;1&#34; /&gt;](http://www.flickr.com/photos/cleverswine/4126822232/sizes/l/)&lt;figcaption class=&#34;wp-caption-text&#34;&gt;New Couch&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &#xA;&lt;p&gt;We got our new couch from JCPenney last weekend.  We weren’t expecting it until mid-December because we had custom fabric put on it.  We’re glad to have it for Thanksgiving because we’re having company over for food and games.  I think the red (berry) fabric was a good choice, as it adds some color to the room and it matches the chair we recently purchased.  The rug is new as well.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
